{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_7_level_main_07-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_7",
  "stageId": "main_07-01",
  "title": "別離之夜",
  "storyCode": "7-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "706ec5d61402ef724ade4d14a8b8152e26080972d868dbbd248032d89f5d2077",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:30 p.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "編號00000-00002，接入權限-8。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，歡迎訪問羅德島綜合生物處理室，已依據生物資料對您的意圖進行判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "另外，系統檢測到您的心情不佳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "少煩我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "Dr.{@nickname}表現出一定的攻擊性。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "請放心，系統不會因此電擊你，不用太過顧忌系統對你的檢測。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "Dr.{@nickname}陷入了沉默。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "無論是無聲抗議還是不願進行溝通，我認為這都是一種孤獨性精神障礙症的表現。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "當然，請便，系統會平等對待所有人。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "該怎麼樣才算是好心情？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "好與壞是一種主觀判斷。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "不過，本系統集成了幾乎所有有記載的精神活動狀態，以及各類神經興奮的激素標準。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "所以你可以認為，本系統的主觀判斷是無限接近客觀事實的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "因此，無論Dr.{@nickname}將要採取什麼樣的行動，系統都能在一定程度上進行模擬。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "所以，想做什麼就去做吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "PRTS具備相應的無害安撫機能。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "PRTS",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "當你採取過激行動時你會立刻昏厥並在3.55個工作時後醒來，這可以保證你的行為向正常標準貼近。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Welcome home, Doctor。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......這裡真的能算家嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你是，Dr.{@nickname}？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你好？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......是你，沒有錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我感覺到了......雖然，不太一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不過......你懷裡的人，穿的制服......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我可以問一問，你抱著的是誰嗎？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一介戰士。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "戰士？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "啊......她在你身上留下了傷口。她是敵人？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "不，不是......這傷口，不是會殺死人的傷口。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "一位同胞。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "她也是感染者......？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "不，你不是這個意思。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你像是失去了什麼。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "一個朋友。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "她是你的朋友？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "可是，朋友......她和你相聯繫的時間，很短很短。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "我不知道......我不知道這會不會很快就消失。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你能......感受到什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "所有人相互交流的痕跡。氣味，溫度，形狀"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我也不太清楚，但她......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "女孩將手伸向霜星。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（默許）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "唔。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "不。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "你不想我這麼做吧？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "不，不是。我是外人。我和她沒有聯繫。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "這不是我能做的事情，對吧？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "不好意思。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "（出聲阻止）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你也和阿米婭一樣，能讀心？",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "不，沒有，我不能......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "阿米婭是特別的。我知道阿米婭的法術......也覺得她很辛苦。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "5",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "我......我想，我不能碰她。我也不能感受她。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "她與這片大地的聯繫和我沒有關聯。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "我沒有......沒有理由去觸碰她。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我沒法那麼快理解你的反應。",
          "value": "6",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "其他幹員，也會這麼說。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "羅德島上，大家都很有個性......但我可能更奇怪一些。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "抱歉。",
          "value": "7",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "沒關係，沒關係的。我已經習慣了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "你是要......用這個機器吧？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "8",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "請，請不要生氣......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "你不說話，我有些......有些不知道該做什麼。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "你是要......用這個機器吧？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "對不起，小姑娘。",
          "value": "9",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "沒事的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "比起被別人害怕，我更願意別人認真對我說話。所以，沒問題的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "你是要......用這個機器吧？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "如果這裡確實是感染者最後歸宿的話。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我來幫你吧。先讓我看一下記錄。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗯，沒問題，這個艙室已經清理過了。把她放在這個平台上吧。輕一點，嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "之後平台會收進去，然後......等艙門關上，按下這個鍵就可以了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你很熟悉操作。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊，因為我操作過許多遍了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "為什麼.......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "羅德島的感染者，最後都會到這裡來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "如果是我認識，我感受過的人，我的隊員，我都會自己操作。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "原本的使用說明書很複雜，系統簡單的操作方式，我都記在終端上了。只要稍微看看，身體就會熟悉那種感覺。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "什麼感覺？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊......大概就像鏈子一樣。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "鏈子......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "說是兩個人之間牽著的線也可以。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "送走和你有聯繫的人，是解開纏在他們身上的線。線的另一邊還是繫在我們身上，可哪怕沒有再繫著誰了，線卻也垂不下來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那種感覺，是身體裡有什麼消失了的感覺。已經不知道那裡是什麼，卻又知道，他們曾經在，也不會回來。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "為什麼要去熟悉這種感覺？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "因為只有熟悉了，才不會突然地痛起來吧？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......你究竟是......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "打擾一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "身在羅德島生物感染綜合處理室的精英幹員Rosmontis，你的識別碼將在15mins後失效。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "接下來我將為你進行更新，請在原地停留十五秒左右。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "另外，接舷區發生了小規模的武裝衝突，可以的話請在識別碼更新後進行支援，以期減少我方資源的損耗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊，嗯。我知道了，馬上就去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我在終端上記一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "第六次提示你，如果你願意向本系統開放權限，系統可以直接將資訊發送至......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這是只有我......只有我能寫的東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "明白。請。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "精英幹員......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "PRTS指的是我。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我該叫你Rosmontis嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你可以叫我......迷迭香。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......她，叫什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我想......我想至少知道她的名字。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "霜星。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
